flowchart TD
    A([Start setupLoRa])

    A --> B[Print 'Initializing SX1262...']
    B --> C[Delay 1000 ms]

    C --> D[Initialize LoRa Radio<br/>LoRa.begin]

    D --> E{Initialization Successful?}

    E -- No --> F[Print Radio Init Error]
    F --> G[[Infinite Loop]]

    E -- Yes --> H[Attach Packet Received Interrupt<br/>onPacketReceived]

    H --> I[Start Continuous Receive]

    I --> J{Receive Started?}

    J -- No --> K[Print Start Receive Error]
    J -- Yes --> L[Print Receiver Ready]

    K --> M([setupLoRa Complete])
    L --> M
